     "GEO for Dentists: How to Get Your Practice Recommended by AI",
     "GEO for dentists means making your dental practice easy for AI tools like Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT and Perplexity to find, trust and recommend when patients ask about treatments, costs or a dentist near them. It relies on clear treatment pages, honest cost information, consistent local listings, genuine reviews and visible dentist credentials.",
